  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 28f310e05cc019a48855581da30b411e, type: 3}
  m_Name: BatangasLomiHistory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: Up next, we're heading to Batangas for a hearty bowl of lomi! Let's find
      out what makes this noodle dish a local favorite.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Let me tell you the history and origin of batangas lomi.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: 'Batangas Lomi is especially associated with, '
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: 'Lipa City and reflects the influence of Chinese noodle traditions in the
      Philippines. '
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: One popular account credits Chinese immigrant To Kim Eng with helping popularize
      the local version in the late 1960s.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Its thick broth, chewy egg noodles, and generous toppings of pork, liver,
      meatballs, and kikiam make it stand out from other noodle soups.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Over time, lomi houses became an important part of Batangas food culture.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: Did you know?
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: Batangas Lomi is famous for its thick broth and generous toppings.
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
  - text: Some versions even leave out vegetables entirely!
    characterSprite: {fileID: -8056027616224820867, guid: 783feefcd5809a142b7b39ffbbe1c917, type: 3}
